@startuml component
title ninetyninebob-api — Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Client

package "app/" {
  [routes/api.php\n(register/login/me/logout)] as routes
  [AuthController] as auth
  [RegisterRequest / LoginRequest\n(FormRequest validation)] as req
  [User model\n(HasApiTokens + Notifiable)] as user
}

package "vendor (Laravel 11)" {
  [Sanctum guard\nauth:sanctum middleware] as sanctum
  [PersonalAccessToken] as pat
  [Hash facade\n(bcrypt)] as hash
}

database "PostgreSQL\n(users + personal_access_tokens)" as db

Client --> routes : POST /api/register|/login\nGET /api/me|/user\nPOST /api/logout
routes --> req : validate body
routes --> auth
auth --> user : create / findByEmail
auth --> hash : Hash::make password
auth --> pat : createToken / findToken / delete
sanctum --> pat : look up bearer
pat --> db
user --> db

note bottom of auth
  Bug fixes vs original:
  - register hashes via Hash::make (was a model
    mutator that could be bypassed)
  - login no longer logs raw credentials
  - login returns generic 'Invalid credentials.'
    instead of leaking unauth state
  - logout uses bearerToken() fallback when
    currentAccessToken() is a TransientToken
end note
@enduml
